description:
Does exact arithmetic and figure handling over the matter's verified figures, so no model ever computes or types a number. op "calc" runs fn (sum, diff, ratio, pct, date_add, date_diff, business_days) over operands that are verified finding values such as {"ref": "F12.v1"} or literals with a unit, and returns a worksheet with an id (wid) the deliverable can cite; a total in the deliverable must be such a worksheet. op "handles" gives each verified figure of fids (all when null) a codename such as {Zephyr}; drafters write the codename and the renderer substitutes the exact value. op "table" returns a Markdown key-figures table built only from verified values. Do not use it to estimate, round or infer a figure the record does not state, and do not use a quarantined finding's value: it is refused, never treated as zero.
Example: {"op": "calc", "fn": "sum", "operands": [{"ref": "F3.v1", "literal": null, "unit": null}, {"ref": "F7.v2", "literal": null, "unit": null}], "holidays": null, "fids": null, "salientTop": null}
Example: {"op": "calc", "fn": "business_days", "operands": [{"ref": null, "literal": "2026-11-12", "unit": "date"}, {"ref": null, "literal": "10", "unit": "days"}], "holidays": ["2026-11-26"], "fids": null, "salientTop": null}
Example: {"op": "handles", "fn": null, "operands": null, "holidays": null, "fids": null, "salientTop": 12}
